<view class="page"><view class="card" wx:if="{{invalid}}"><view class="error">订单草稿不存在或账户已变化，请返回重新填写。</view><button bindtap="back">返回</button></view>
<block wx:else><view class="notice">MOCK 模拟支付 · 不是真实微信支付，不发生扣款。最终订单金额以服务端为准。</view>
<view class="card"><view class="title">确认订单 · {{typeText}}</view><view class="line">取件：{{draft.fromContact}} {{draft.fromPhone}}</view><view class="line">{{draft.fromAddress}}</view><view class="line">送达：{{draft.toContact}} {{draft.toPhone}}</view><view class="line">{{draft.toAddress}}</view><view class="line">物品：{{draft.goodsDesc}}</view><view class="line">预估距离：{{draft.distanceM}}米 · 重量：{{draft.weightKg}}公斤</view><view class="hint">备注：{{draft.remark || '无'}}</view></view>
<view class="card"><view class="title">预估费用</view><view class="row line" wx:for="{{quote.items}}" wx:key="key"><text>{{item.label}}</text><text>¥{{item.amountText}}</text></view><view class="row line"><text>合计</text><text class="price">¥{{quote.totalText}}</text></view><view class="notice" wx:if="{{orderId}}">订单已创建（ID：{{orderId}}），重试仅支付该订单，不会重复创建。</view><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || uncertain}}" bindtap="submit">{{orderId ? '重试 MOCK 模拟支付' : '确认创建并 MOCK 模拟支付'}}</button><button wx:if="{{orderId}}" class="secondary" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="detail">查看已创建订单</button><view class="notice" wx:if="{{uncertain}}">创建结果待核实，已阻止重复提交。请先在订单列表检查，再从已有订单继续操作。</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="orders" disabled="{{busy}}">前往订单列表核实</button><view class="hint">网络超时可能表示创建结果未知。服务端未提供幂等键，请勿在核实前重新填写相同订单。</view></view>
</block></view>
